    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseYuanZhenANElEGYII",
      "translationRaw": "Wejoked，longago，aboutoneofusdying，Butsuddenly，beforemyeyes，youaregone。Almostallyourclotheshavebeengivenaway；Yourneedleworkissealed，Idarenotlookatit。。。。Icontinueyourbountytoourmenandourmaids--Sometimes，inadream，Ibringyougifts。。。。Thisisasorrowthatallmankindmustknow--Butnotasthoseknowitwhohavebeenpoortogether。",
